flowchart LR
    Request[Caller-controlled stable-core request]
    Clients[CLI, MCP, Pi, future hosts]
    Socket[Owner-private authenticated local socket]
    Daemon[Long-lived authority daemon]
    Ledger[(Metadata-only ledger and Evidence)]
    Queue[Bounded dispatch and backpressure]
    Workers[Short-lived isolated workers]
    Fixed[Fixed stable-core executor]
    Transient[(Bounded transient channels)]

    Request --> Clients
    Clients --> Socket
    subgraph PrivateServiceBoundary[Owner-private authority boundary]
        Socket --> Daemon
        Daemon --> Ledger
        Daemon --> Queue
        Queue --> Workers
        Workers --> Fixed
    end
    Clients <--> Transient
    Transient <--> Workers
    Daemon -. lifecycle, cancellation, recovery .-> Workers
